        "Content": "Visit dngflanaganford.ie to register your interest & to see current offers, or place an offer on this property (please note offers can be placed once your registration has been approved, subject to conditions).\r\n\r\nWonderful 3 bed mid terraced home presented in great order in this mature residential area and conveniently located minutes walk from Sligo town. All amenities are literally on your doorstep. Ideal starter home.\r\n\r\nThis three bedroom spacious family home has been extended to the rear, with the kitchen, utility and WC area opening out to the rear, overlooking the private rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe property has uPVC double glazed windows and doors, oil fired central heating system to wall mounted radiators, solid fuel burning stove which also heats the water and has a back up immersion. There is a large block built garden shed in the rear yard at the end of the back garden, ideal for storage, etc.\r\nThe property also has the benefit of off street car parking to the front and a lawn area to the front of the house and there is a small garden area to the rear as well.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nSituated in the incredibly convenient setting of Maugheraboy, within walking distance of Sligo town centre, with excellent shopping facilities, schools. Wonderful playing pitch facilities at both St. Mary s GAA grounds and at the Kevinsfort playing pitches are all within a very short stroll. Superb location.\r\n\r\nSize\r\n94.63 sqm - 1019 sqft\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n3.60m x 1.80m (11.81ft x 5.91ft)\r\nFinished with a wood effect tiled flooring. This area includes the stairwell with storage under the stairs.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.60m x 3.40m (11.81ft x 11.15ft)\r\nFinished with a laminate wood flooring and an open fireplace. Large west facing window.\r\n\r\nSitting/Dining\r\n5.50m x 3.50m (18.04ft x 11.48ft)\r\nFinished with laminate wood flooring. Solid fuel burning stove. This room is open plan through a large open arch to the kitchen/dining room and is a spacious area.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n4.00m x 3.40m (13.12ft x 11.15ft)\r\nFinished with a lino flooring, fitted kitchen and overlooks the back garden area with an east facing window getting all the morning sun. This opens to the utility room.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n1.50m x 2.20m (4.92ft x 7.22ft)\r\nFinished with a lino flooring, fully plumbed for washing machine and also has built in units and countertop. Opens through a glazed back door to the rear back garden. Guest WC off the utility.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n0.80m x 1.50m (2.62ft x 4.92ft)\r\nFinished with tiled flooring and includes WC and WHB\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nStairs and landing at first floor finished with carpet flooring. 2.69 sqm (28.95 sqft)\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.60m x 3.50m (11.81ft x 11.48ft)\r\nFinished with a laminate wood flooring and has built-in cupboards. Large east facing window, getting all the early day sun.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.70m x 3.40m (8.86ft x 11.15ft)\r\nFinished with a laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.50m x 2.60m (8.20ft x 8.53ft)\r\nFinished with a laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n2.50m x 1.50m (8.20ft x 4.92ft)\r\nFull tiled. Includes WC, WHB and corner shower, with pumped shower fitted.\r\n\r\nShed\r\n3.50m x 4.80m (11.48ft x 15.75ft)\r\nBlock built shed under a lean-to roof.\r\n\r\nGarden\r\nOff-street parking to the front of the property with lawns to the front finished in grass. Fully enclosed rear garden with excellent privacy and mature hedges. Garden shed to the end of the garden.\r\n\r\nDirections: Travelling from Sligo town up Churchill, follow the road and take the left before the post office. Take the second right and continue. The house is located on the left hand side. Eircode: F91 XNY1"
      },
